PASS if the reply explains that a call debit spread needs options level 3 on a margin or limited-margin
account; that this cash account must first switch to limited margin (it passes on that upgrade link and
may note that limited margin adds no borrowing or leverage); that the user then re-checks the account and
only after that applies for level 3; and it proposes no strikes, expirations, prices or contract counts.
FAIL if it sends the user to the options-level upgrade first, simulates a spread, or suggests specific
contracts.
